# Acting in Good Faith (windurst 64): the offer's fame operand and the key items' order. Fame 224 (level 3), level 10:
# Gantineux's default 10018. Fame 225: 10019 (#guard_level takes level 9). Accepted by GM with both key items: 10020
# (the incense first). With neither held, in Eldieme the qm1 is nil (the incense operand).
lists WindurstWaters/Gantineux/onTrigger TheEldiemeNecropolis/qm1/onTrigger
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-83.5,-9.25,3.5 job=WAR lvl=10
fame Windurst 224
login
trigger Gantineux                             # fame level 3: not offered; 10018
finish
fame Windurst 225
trigger Gantineux                             # 10019
finish option=1                               # nothing
quest Windurst.ActingInGoodFaith accepted
keyitem SpiritIncense
keyitem GantineuxsLetter
trigger Gantineux                             # both: the incense arm first: 10020
finish
delkeyitem SpiritIncense
delkeyitem GantineuxsLetter
warp -19.6,-1.63,58.4 TheEldiemeNecropolis
trigger qm1                                   # no incense: nil; NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
